Observations from Customer Retention Analysis:
The cohort retention heatmap indicates that while a solid base of customers makes repeat purchases, the retention rates drop significantly in subsequent months.
The data suggests that new customers have strong initial engagement, which tapers off, highlighting an opportunity for targeted re-engagement strategies.
